{"3998980": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Project Signal", "steam_appid": 3998980, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Project Signal,</i> you are a nameless trekker searching for potential UFO evidence in a remote wilderness. If there is such knowledge to be found, said knowledge is dangerous to possess - and this is why you will not be alone in the wilderness. Strange men will come after you when you discover ''too much,'' intent on making you disappear forever.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Investigate...</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are given a large wilderness to explore with many points of interest. In this semi-randomized area, various pieces of evidence and phenomenon can be found. Discovering evidence will bring you closer to victory, but also make the experience turn more dangerous.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >...and Escape</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Once you have gathered enough evidence, you will receive visitors. Black-clad men are now after you, intent on making you disappear. Can you outrun them and escape the vast forest?</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>FEATURES</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >large, open 3D environment with points of interest and randomized elements</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >keep your ears open and hold a sharp sense of orientation - or lose yourself in the wilds</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >three difficulty levels</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >post-game statistics</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In<i> Project Signal,</i> you are a nameless trekker searching for potential UFO evidence in a remote wilderness. If there is such knowledge to be found, said knowledge is dangerous to possess - and this is why you will not be alone in the wilderness. Strange men will come after you when you discover ''too much,'' intent on making 